  "id": "smoky-three-cheese-macaroni-and-cheese",
  "name": "Smoky Three-Cheese Macaroni and Cheese",
  "subtitle": "Creamy baked pasta with smoky cheese and a crisp crumb topping",
  "description": "Elbow macaroni is folded into a creamy blend of smoked Gouda, Cheddar, Swiss, and Parmesan, then baked with a seasoned Parmesan breadcrumb topping.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
